  "route": "original",
  "notes": "Backlog game, picked from RAWG's most-added list for its year (docs/PLAN.md section 2 ordering). No StrategyWiki page under \"Immortals Fenyx Rising\" or \"Immortals: Fenyx Rising\". Fandom has no page on immortals-fenyx-rising.fandom.com; immortalsfenyxrising.fandom.com answers under \"Immortals: Fenyx Rising\", but with only 9 linked pages; names only were looked at, nothing copied. RAWG's slug for the game is gods-monsters, and RAWG has separate entries for A New God, Myths of the Eastern Realm and The Lost Gods. The Steam app is 2221920. None of the 68 Steam achievements are hidden. The 14 achievements put in the expansions chapter come from the end of the schema (after \"Photobomb\") and name new content; which add-on each belongs to was not checked, so they share one chapter. Four others from that block (\"Wardrobe Warrior\", \"Zoomies\", \"Stuff of Legends\", \"Full House\") read like base-game goals and were sorted by theme; check them. \"Last Hero Standing\" (achieve hero status) was put in upgrades as a guess."
